    fn read_text() -> Future<Result<text, IoError>>:
        """Read all content as text."""
        Future(state: [], poll_result: Poll.Ready(self.stream.read_text()))  # @workaround bug=mir-unresolved-method-20261031 reason=pinned stage2 MIR lowers the generic Future.from_value<T> callee body with T unsubstituted (E-MIR-TYPE-TypeParam, unaffected by explicit call-site type args); construct the Future record directly, identical to from_value's own body

